# NaMiOS — ngon ngu hien thi Plasma Shell MAC DINH = TIENG ANH (quyet dinh
# Cuong 10/11/2026, doi tu ban truoc mac dinh tieng Viet). Khac voi locale
# he thong (en_US.UTF-8 mac dinh, dat o hooks/normal/0100-locale-vi +
# --bootappend-live cua auto/config) - file nay rieng cho tang dich Plasma UI
# cua tai khoan skel (user moi tao se ke thua file nay).
#
# verified_on_host: NO.
#
# LY DO doi mac dinh: ban dich tieng Viet (lop phu vi_NM + goi l10n upstream)
# hien chi phu MOT PHAN giao dien Plasma -> tron tieng Viet/tieng Anh doc
# khong chuyen nghiep cho an tuong dau. Nen de MAC DINH tieng Anh thuan,
# nhat quan.
#
# TIENG VIET VAN CHON DUOC NGAY — khong go bo gi: goi dich vi_NM + goi l10n
# KDE van cai day du (xem package-lists/0200-locale-vi.list.chroot va
# 0210-l10n-vi.list.chroot). Nguoi dung tu chuyen bang System Settings ->
# Region & Language -> chon "Tieng Viet"; luc do Plasma se tu ghi lai file
# nay (hoac ~/.config/plasma-localerc cua ho) thanh:
#   [Formats]      LANG=vi_VN.UTF-8
#   [Translations] LANGUAGE=vi_NM:vi:en_US
# (vi_NM = lop phu dich cua NaMiOS, dat truoc `vi` upstream -> per-message
# fallback: NaMiOS -> vi upstream -> en). Xem
# docs/l10n/UPSTREAM-VI-OVERLAY-SPEC.md §4.1.
#
# GIOI HAN THAT (giu nguyen tu ban truoc, khong doi): du o che do nao, cac
# goi "KDE l10n" dich Plasma sang tieng Viet phu thuoc catalog dich tung goi
# rieng le, CO THE khong day du tren Debian 13 trixie — khong bao cao thanh
# "da Viet hoa toan bo Plasma".

[Formats]
LANG=en_US.UTF-8

[Translations]
LANGUAGE=en_US
